-top:2em;border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:8px;\"><strong>Grupo Privus</strong><br/>CONTRATANTE</td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:8px;\"><strong>André Juan Velasco Barbosa</strong><br/>CONTRATADA</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin-top:2em;\"><strong>Testemunhas:</strong></p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td style=\"width:48%;vertical-align:top;padding:6px;\">1) ________________________________<br/><br/>Nome: _____________________________<br/>CPF: ______________________________</td><td style=\"width:4%;\"></td><td style=\"width:48%;vertical-align:top;padding:6px;\">2) ________________________________<br/><br/>Nome: _____________________________<br/>CPF: ______________________________</td></tr></table>', 'uploads/contratos/contrato_1775565773_69d4fbcdb2811.pdf', 'assinado', '9e3853a8f95d369f0c7a940c5567437d1081940380a93c450', NULL, 1, '2026-04-07', NULL, 'Gerado automaticamente ao desligamento do colaborador.', '2026-04-07 12:42:53', '2026-04-07 17:08:11'),
